  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortal Shi Hou cheers on finding the rank seven immortal material domination copper inside a round ball wooden eagle nest. Within those nests sit rank seven immortal materials in each one, either metals or ores, and in huge quantity.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "nest-haul",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_shi_hou"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper Seal mountain is completely formed from all kinds of copper, with mortal coppers in the greatest amount and immortal coppers only a small portion, mostly rank six. The highest level copper on that mountain is a unique rank seven copper, the famous domination copper. With that copper present, the mountain essentially cannot support another rank seven copper.",
      "chapters": [
        1615
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "copper-seal-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper Seal Mountain once produced domination copper, a rank seven immortal material. After a myriad tribulation left the mountain half destroyed and molten, it could no longer produce any.",
      "chapters": [
        2050
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "production-lost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Domination copper is firm and dominant, inlaid in soil and glittering with cold metallic light, and is recognized as a rank seven immortal material. In a normal production area of domination copper there would not be other rank seven metallic materials beside it. It is named among metal path immortal materials. In the same underground cache, crystal essence is first judged highest in quantity, with water path and lightning path crystal essences named when Black Tigress guesses at Hu Land; those essences are covered on water path crystal essence and lightning path crystal essence. Further search finds earth blood veins and a black-yellow heart in that vault; those finds are covered on earth blood veins and black-yellow heart.",
      "chapters": [
        2076
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "metal-path-material",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
